{
  "layout": "oz_vpp_pane_mirror",
  "note": "Ядро › Дзеркало Discord (VPP rework 2026-11-12, design §5.1; not drawn in the mockup): one row per kind a module of the series registered for mirroring (mirror_list), with its state, the server's own sentence on what switching it does, and a switch that asks on the window's confirm strip before mirror_set. Moved here from the files page. THE KIND NAMES ARE NOT HERE: they come from the modules (OZ_MirrorOps.List), so the core neither names another mod's kind nor caps how many there may be; the rows are generated into MirrorStrip from oz_vpp_mirror_row. Created by OZ_VppMenu.OnCreate; the shell moves it into the content area. Names MirrorStrip and BtnMrRefresh are read by OZ_VppMenu.c.",
  "root": {
    "frame": {
      "name": "PaneMirror",
      "size": "$vpp.content",
      "at": [0, "$vpp.paneY"],
      "hidden": true,
      "priority": 2,
      "note": "Hidden: ShowPane shows the open page and hides the rest.",
      "children": [
        {
          "vbox": {
            "name": "MrBody",
            "size": "fill",
            "children": [
              {
                "frame": {
                  "name": "MrHead",
                  "h": 60,
                  "children": [
                    {"label": {"name": "MrTitle", "at": [24, 9], "size": [520, 26], "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_MR_TITLE", "font": "title", "color": "$vppText"}},
                    {"label": {"name": "MrSub", "at": [24, 35], "size": [760, 18], "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_MR_SUB", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                    {"button": {"name": "BtnMrRefresh", "anchor": "right", "at": [24, 15], "size": [160, 30], "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_MR_REFRESH", "font": "small", "bg": "$vppRaised", "edge": "$vppEdge", "color": "$vppText"}},
                    {"panel": {"name": "MrHeadRule", "at": [0, 59], "size": [1060, 1], "color": "$vppEdge"}}
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "panel": {
                  "name": "MrMain",
                  "h": "fill",
                  "color": "$vppPanel",
                  "inset": 24,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "vbox": {
                        "name": "MrCol",
                        "size": "fill",
                        "gap": 12,
                        "children": [
                          {"text": {"name": "MrIntro", "h": 40, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_MR_INTRO"}},
                          {"frame": {"name": "MirrorStrip", "h": "fill", "note": "One generated oz_vpp_mirror_row per kind, placed by OZ_VppMenu.LayoutMirror."}},
                          {"text": {"name": "MrNote", "h": 40, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_MR_NOTE"}}
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
